// Per-host niri overrides. Rendered by chezmoi; empty where nothing applies.
{{- if dig "tuxedo" false . }}

// Hybrid-GPU laptop: the external DP port hangs off the RTX 3050 while niri
// renders on the Intel iGPU by default, so every DP-4 frame is rendered on
// Intel and copied to NVIDIA. After a lock/DPMS cycle that path degrades into
// a laggy cursor and animations with the dGPU pinned at max clock
// (niri-wm/niri#3095, #4708). Rendering on the dGPU is the fix the niri FAQ
// recommends; it costs battery when undocked. renderD129 = 0000:01:00.0 (NVIDIA).
debug {
    render-drm-device "/dev/dri/renderD129"
    emulate-zero-presentation-time
}
{{- end }}
